    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a force of nature!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive is a dark yet hopeful adventure where you create new growth with every step, use the remains of fallen foes to amplify your magical powers, and overcome deadly challenges to transform the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Ashen Graveyard lie the restless dead. As the last scion of nature's magic, use your abilities to slay ranks of enemies, sowing new life with each foe felled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bloom mechanic</i></strong><i> </i>- Transform the world as you adventure! Create color, life and magic with each move. New routes and optional challenges will open to the regrowth of nature. Secrets are hidden for dedicated players to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quick, Responsive Combat -</i></strong> Use your trusty shovel &amp; an array of magical abilities to scour the undead and plant new life. Manipulate traps and other environmental hazards to your advantage. Inflict status effects on your foes with  Thornwave and Stifling Spore, and unleash<strong><i> </i></strong>a powerful Sunburst that turns foes into flowers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hand drawn art and animation</i></strong><i> </i>- Explore a dark world where each character and frame is lovingly handcrafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Orchestral soundtrack</i></strong>-by Owen Andruchow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a force of nature!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive is a dark yet hopeful adventure where you create new growth with every step, use the remains of fallen foes to amplify your magical powers, and overcome deadly challenges to transform the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Ashen Graveyard lie the restless dead. As the last scion of nature's magic, use your abilities to slay ranks of enemies, sowing new life with each foe felled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bloom mechanic</i></strong><i> </i>- Transform the world as you adventure! Create color, life and magic with each move. New routes and optional challenges will open to the regrowth of nature. Secrets are hidden for dedicated players to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quick, Responsive Combat -</i></strong> Use your trusty shovel &amp; an array of magical abilities to scour the undead and plant new life. Manipulate traps and other environmental hazards to your advantage. Inflict status effects on your foes with  Thornwave and Stifling Spore, and unleash<strong><i> </i></strong>a powerful Sunburst that turns foes into flowers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hand drawn art and animation</i></strong><i> </i>- Explore a dark world where each character and frame is lovingly handcrafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Orchestral soundtrack</i></strong>-by Owen Andruchow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
